Finished in a matte metallic bronze and dark silver aesthetic, "Shotgun" features an ultra-streamlined, aerodynamic plate design with a closing visor mask to reduce drag. Tony integrated specialized interlocking armor plates that seal tight during flight, transforming the suit into a sleek airborne wedge powered by a heavy rear thruster system.

In Iron Man 3, Mark XL plays a featured role in combat: Tony personally suits up into "Shotgun" during the battle at the Norco oil rig, engaging Aldrich Killian in fast-paced hand-to-hand combat before the suit suffers heavy damage, leading Tony to eject and trigger its detonation.
